 Chapter 2: Structuring the Payload (MIME)Email is not just text. It’s MIME (Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions). If you just send “Hello”, it might land in Spam. You need headers. msg := []byte("Subject: " + subject + "
" + "MIME-version: 1.0;
" + "Content-Type: text/html; charset="UTF-8";
" + "
" + body)
